  i push() returns the new length of the array, not the added item or the array. Using this length is usually a mistake.
  
  i Call push() as its own statement. If you need the new length, read the length property of the array afterward.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

